ling Scared Again</h2>\n<p>Viewers are feeling scared again.</p>\n<h2>Repeating the Phrase &#x27;We’re Doing Hollow Cure&#x27;</h2>\n<p>They are repeating the phrase &#x27;We’re doing hollow cure.&#x27;</p>\n<h2>Greeting Someone</h2>\n<p>Someone says &#x27;Oh, hello!&#x27;</p>\n<h2>Instructing to Hold On</h2>\n<p>Someone instructs to &#x27;hold on.&#x27;</p>\n<h2>Commanding to Stop</h2>\n<p>Someone commands to &#x27;stop.&#x27;</p>\n<h2>Mentioning &#x27;Sake&#x27;</h2>\n<p>They mention &#x27;sake&#x27;.</p>\n<h2>Mentioning &#x27;Sake&#x27; Again</h2>\n<p>They mention &#x27;sake&#x27; again.</p>\n<h2>Saying &#x27;Okay&#x27;</h2>\n<p>Someone says &#x27;Okay.&#x27;</p>\n<h2>Exclaiming &#x27;Oh, Look!&#x27;</h2>\n<p>Someone says &#x27;Oh, look!&#x27;</p>\n<h2>Thanking the Audience and Praising Otsu&#x27;s Idea</h2>\n<p>The speaker thanked the audience for their support and praised Otsu&#x27;s idea.</p>\n<h2>Announcing Future Holocure Play</h2>\n<p>The speaker announced they will play more Holocure next week.</p>\n<h2>Concluding with a Farewell</h2>\n<p>The speaker concluded the conversation with a farewell.</p>\n<h2>記事情報</h2>\n<p>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aomckVmDiLY</p>",
